<title>NEW ZEALAND: National Mutual lists in NZ at NZ$2.00.</title>
<headline>National Mutual lists in NZ at NZ$2.00.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Mutual on Tuesday listed on the New Zealand Stock Exchange at NZ$2.00 per share versus a retail application price of NZ$1.70.</p>
<p>The listing was simultaneous with its float on the Australian Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
